./docs/stability_report.md:5:Completed **2,496 games on 208 distinct world seeds**, using both seats and the natural official interpreter. All games finished without callback failures. Maximum candidate callback time was **439.3 ms** on this local run. Candidate, opponent, harness and required Router asset hashes were checked; prepared agent bytes remain unchanged.
